        <h2>Risk Management</h2>
        <p>Before pitching the plan, we ran it through a risk register — three external risks (student engagement, recruiter buy-in, alumni fatigue) and four internal ones (platform failures, data privacy, misalignment with Career Services, and low-quality prep material), each graded on probability and impact with a specific mitigation.</p>
        <div class="risk-table-wrap">
          <table class="risk-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Code</th>
